<p>Rundown of the methods in the <code>AuthController</code>:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>register</code>: Handles user registration. Validates the request data, creates a new user, and returns an access token.</li>
<li><code>login</code>: Handles user login. Validates the request data, checks the user credentials, and returns an access token.</li>
<li><code>logout</code>: Logs out the authenticated user by deleting the current access token.</li>
</ul>
