<p>This pagination method will limit the number of tasks returned to 15 per page, significantly reducing the payload size for large datasets.</p>
<p>The response will now include additional pagination metadata such as the total number of items, the number of pages, and links to the next and previous pages, allowing for easy navigation through the entire collection of tasks.</p>
